# W10c, host a (k5): hosts stag0101 and goes into dng101b1 alone (the depart action, as W6) before b arrives; once b is
# in a's instance in a stage group of its own (stag0101, solo-led), a removes it and plays on in the cave.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
depart dng101b1 0 until stage=dng101b1,control
log a in dng101b1
idle until epoch>=@260
remove {user:b}
log a removed b
idle until epoch>=@380
log a still in the cave
